@startuml
title SQ01 — Konsultasi Asisten AI
actor Pelapor
boundary "UI Lapor" as UI
control AiAssistantController as AIC
control GeminiAssistant as GA
participant "Google Gemini" as Gemini

Pelapor -> UI : Tulis pertanyaan/detail kejadian
UI -> AIC : POST /lapor/asisten-ai\nmessage + history
AIC -> AIC : Validasi + rate limit
AIC -> GA : ask(message, history)
GA -> Gemini : generateContent\nAPI key dari server
alt sukses
  Gemini --> GA : jawaban Bahasa Indonesia
  GA --> AIC : answer
  AIC --> UI : 200 JSON
  UI --> Pelapor : Panduan/draf
else timeout, 429, atau 5xx
  GA -> Gemini : retry terbatas
  AIC --> UI : 503 pesan aman
end
@enduml

@startuml
title SQ02 — Laporan Masyarakat hingga Selesai
actor Pelapor
boundary "Form Lapor" as UI
control PelaporController as PC
database Database as DB
actor Admin
control ReportStatusController as RSC
control CompleteReportController as CRC

Pelapor -> UI : Isi satu jenis Lapor\ntanpa NIK
UI -> PC : POST /lapor
PC -> PC : Validasi input
PC -> DB : Simpan GuestAccess/Report(type=lapor)\nHistory + Attachment
PC -> DB : Notifikasi Admin aktif
PC --> UI : Kode laporan

Admin -> RSC : Majukan status satu tahap
RSC -> DB : submitted → received → verifying → in_progress
Admin -> CRC : Lengkapi hasil, petugas, lokasi, bukti
CRC -> DB : Transaksi Activity eksternal\nOfficer + Attachment + Report completed
Pelapor -> PC : Lihat status dan kirim feedback
PC -> DB : Simpan feedback sekali
@enduml

@startuml
title SQ03 — Dashboard Super Admin dengan Peta Terpadu
actor "Super Admin" as SA
control SuperAdminController as SC
database "Reports + Activities + Audit" as DB
boundary Dashboard as UI

SA -> SC : GET /super-admin/dashboard
SC -> DB : Statistik, audit terbaru,\ntitik berkoordinat
DB --> SC : Dataset dashboard
SC --> UI : Kartu + grafik + peta
UI --> SA : Dashboard terpadu
note over SA,UI
Tidak ada menu Peta terpisah,
Manajemen Organisasi, atau peringatan Aset.
end note
@enduml
